Some customers never receive a receipt. There are no errors in the logs at all — not even a warning.

```csharp
public async Task<IActionResult> Checkout(OrderRequest request, CancellationToken ct)
{
    var order = await _orders.PlaceAsync(request, ct);

    try
    {
        _ = _mailer.SendReceiptAsync(order, ct);
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        _log.LogError(ex, "receipt failed");
    }

    return Ok(order);
}
```

Explain why a failure inside `SendReceiptAsync` produces no log entry whatsoever.

solution.code:
function unobservedFailures(tasks) {
  const out = [];
  for (const task of tasks) {
    if (task.faulted === true && task.awaited === false) {
      out.push(task.id);
    }
  }
  return out;
}

grading.starterCode:
function unobservedFailures(tasks) {
  // Reports every fault, whether or not it was observed.
  const out = [];
  for (const task of tasks) {
    if (task.faulted === true) {
      out.push(task.id);
    }
  }
  return out;
}
